<report>
<title>Probit analysis - @title</title>
<p>constant = @a<br />
slope = @b</p>

<p>Median * Dose = @mxd<br />
<ci>Confidence interval @het = @from to @to</ci></p>

<p>* Dose for centile @centile = @doseq<br />
<ci>Confidence interval @het_cent = @from_cent to @to_cent</ci></p>

<p>Chi<sub>2</sub> (heterogeneity of deviations from model) = @dev  (@df df)  <pval>@{p:pval}</pval></p>

<p>t for slope = @t_slope (@df df_slope)  <pval>@{p_slope:pval}</pval></p>
<block name="warn">
<p><warn>WARNING: slope not significant</warn></p>
</block>
</report>
